rt on the first note and tied-type stop on the second note. To indicate a note should be"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"undamped, use a single tied element with tied-type let-ring. For other ties that are visually attached to a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"single note, such as a tie leading into or out of a repeated section or coda, use two tied elements on the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"same note, one start and one stop."}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Kind","kind":"identifier"}],"type":"topic"}}}